&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Brief&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we increase our launch cadence and expand our launch operations across multiple sites, we are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Senior Program Manager Launch Services&lt;/strong&gt; in our Mission and Launch Operations team in Germany to drive integrated launch planning and scheduling across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will become the central coordination point for launch planning between mission management, launch operations, development and production. Your mission is to ensure that customer commitments, launch site availability, operational capacity, hardware readiness, and development roadmaps are translated into a coherent and executable launch schedule.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Launch Planning &amp;amp; Coordination&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and maintain the integrated launch schedule across missions, campaigns, and launch sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate launch site bookings, flight allocations, and key hardware delivery milestones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment of launch plans with customer commitments and operational readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify capability, resource constraints and bottlenecks before they impact mission execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive resolution of schedule conflicts, critical path issues, and execution risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Forecasting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop launch forecasts and capacity planning to support operational and commercial objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Cost Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report KPIs, mission performance metrics, and launch campaign costs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support budget planning through cost monitoring and forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Executive Reporting &amp;amp; Strategic Alignment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide consolidated schedule, capacity, risk, and performance reporting to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a single source of truth for the launch schedule and launch capacities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualification Checklist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s / Master’s degree in aerospace engineering, business administration or other relevant fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of proven experience in program management, project management, or operations management within aerospace, automotive, manufacturing, defense, or another highly complex engineering environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of technical dependencies and interrelationships across engineering, production and operations organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills and the ability to align teams around common objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication skills and confidence interacting with both technical experts and senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive mindset with strong problem-solving abilities and a focus on execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional proficiency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in launch services, spaceflight operations, aerospace programs, mission management, or launch campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with production planning, capacity planning, and forecasting methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in operational campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Participation Program:&lt;/strong&gt; Share in our success through our virtual company share program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 days of vacation: &lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy the days off to relax and recharge &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company pension plan:&lt;/strong&gt; Secure your future with our company pension plan, featuring a 20% employer contribution after the probation period&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subsidised lunch:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay energised with delicious, subsidised lunches every day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Public transport ticket:&lt;/strong&gt; Commute with ease using a fully financed Deutschlandticket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport Clubs membership:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay fit with our sponsored sports club memberships (EGYM Wellpass)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Grow your skills with an individual learning budget granted after the probation period&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Childcare allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive a childcare allowance for your non-school-age children&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And Much More!&lt;/strong&gt; Discover additional perks and benefits when you join our team. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Who we are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/jW2V5vsMb_k&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We are Isar Aerospace and we are at the forefront of New Space building a modern space business to enable faster, better and cheaper access to space.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Our mission is to help democratise space and use it for good in order to improve life on Earth now and for the future generations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We are a fast-growing company aiming to provide sustainable and environmentally friendly launch solutions for small and medium-sized satellites and constellations into Low Earth Orbit. The company is privately funded by world-leading technology investors with strong commitment and support and our team is made of driven and talented people with a real passion for space innovation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We&#39;re making rockets in a way that hasn&#39;t been done before disrupting a traditional industry. If you are up for the challenge, want to work on cutting-edge projects and be part of a team changing the world for better, come, join us and launch your career!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Want to find out more about us?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.isaraerospace.com/&quot;&gt;www.isaraerospace.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Protection&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We process your personal data for the purpose of managing the recruitment process and assessing your application. For detailed information on how your data is processed, including your rights, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://isaraerospace.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;Disclaimer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Isar Aerospace SE is an equal-opportunity employer committed to fairness and inclusivity. We do not prioritize any specific religion, gender, nationality, or background. Due to security clearance requirements, affiliations with countries listed under § 13 para. 1 no. 17 SÜG may affect the application process. All qualified applicants are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Xometry (NASDAQ: XMTR) powers the industries of today and tomorrow by connecting the people with big ideas to the manufacturers who can bring them to life. Xometry’s digital marketplace gives manufacturers the critical resources they need to grow their business while also making it easy for buyers at Fortune 1000 companies to tap into global manufacturing capacity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every quote Xometry generates in Europe depends on getting two things right at once: an accurate read on manufacturability and a price that wins the job without leaving margin on the table. As Staff Product Manager for Pricing, you will own the strategy and roadmap for how Xometry prices and evaluates manufacturability across the EMEA region — a technical, cross-functional, high-ownership role at the intersection of pricing strategy, manufacturing domain expertise, and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Contribute:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vision &amp;amp; strategy: Define and drive a multi-year roadmap for pricing and manufacturability in Europe, translating regional market dynamics, competitive positioning, and customer behavior into a pricing strategy that accelerates sales growth without sacrificing margin discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Intelligent DFM Workbench: Lead the systems and models that determine how Xometry prices custom parts across European markets — identifying where pricing is too slow, too rigid, or too disconnected from true manufacturability cost, and closing those gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend Xometry&#39;s global AI capabilities into Europe: Partner with global product, data science, and ML engineering teams to adapt and scale Xometry&#39;s AI-driven pricing and manufacturability solutions for the European region — geometry-based cost estimation, manufacturability scoring, and pricing optimization models — rather than building parallel, region-specific tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable outcomes: Define and track the metrics that matter for the region — win rate, price realization, quote-to-order conversion, margin accuracy, and manufacturability sign-off latency — and use them to prioritize the roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functionally: Act as the hub between Sales, Sourcing, Data Science, Engineering, and regional leadership across Europe, and present strategy, trade-offs, and ROI to executive leadership both regionally and globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Europe in global strategy: Ensure European market realities — currency, competitive landscape, regulatory nuance, regional manufacturing capacity — shape Xometry&#39;s global pricing and AI product direction, rather than being retrofitted after the fact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring to Xometry:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of product management experience, including leading AI/ML-powered or technical products in a B2B, marketplace, or manufacturing/engineering environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning a system of record or complex data contract (e.g., a shared record consumed by multiple downstream systems and roles) and the human-in-the-loop workflows built around it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing policy-driven workflows (e.g., approval routing, tiered sign-off, escalation logic) rather than single-user tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating across regions and stakeholder groups to hold a single global design standard, despite real pressure to add customizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to distill technical and operational complexity into a clear narrative for engineers and executives alike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigorous, data-driven approach to prioritization, experimentation, and measuring impact on cycle time, quality, and customer/partner satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with manufacturing processes and DFM principles (CNC machining, sheet metal, additive manufacturing, injection molding) is a strong plus; comfort getting deep into geometry-based feasibility rules is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record partnering closely with data science and ML engineering teams to ship models into production — computer vision, 3D/geometric analysis, or applied LLM/VLM experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Computer Science, Business, or a related field; advanced degree (MBA, MS) a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Xometry is an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran or disability status.&lt;/div&gt;
